  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Unit tests only (Recommended)
  [38;5;246mA test runner plus cases for detectEnvironment. Node's built-in node:test keeps the zero-dependency property intact.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Lint + format
  [38;5;246mESLint + Prettier. Adds devDependencies and a node_modules to a repo that currently has neither.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] None — keep it zero-config
  [38;5;246mNo runner, no linter. detectEnvironment goes untested; correctness rests on review only.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mBrowser-driven test that loads index.html and asserts the resolved endpoint. Heaviest option for a 4-file app.[39m
